OL,4,BWoods set to return next month after   
OL,5,Btwo years out                          
OL,6,GTiger Woods is set to return to        
OL,7,Gcompetitive golf in December for the   
OL,8,Gfirst time in more than two years.     
OL,10,FWoods, 50, has not played in a         
OL,11,Ftraditional ranking event since the    
OL,12,F2024 Open Championship at Royal Troon  
OL,13,Famid a series of off-course issues.    
OL,15,FThe 15-time major champion has endured 
OL,16,Fa challenging few years with a number  
OL,17,Fof injuries and turmoil in his         
OL,18,Fpersonal life.                         
